# Bulk run artifacts: metrics.json, MFILE.DAT, OUT.DAT, logs and the gate
# rollups are all regenerated by run_stage0.py + compare.py.  Summaries and
# verdicts live in arch_surgery/docs/reports/; raw runs are never committed.
# `runs_a3/` is A3 (build-reorder)'s matrix, regenerated by run_a3.py +
# compare_a3.py; same rule, so the pattern covers any `runs*` output directory.
runs/
runs_*/

# The scenario deck is the opposite: decision D9 makes it a frozen artifact of
# this study, patched in place rather than re-pointed at upstream's copies, so
# it must be under version control.  The repository-root .gitignore ignores
# *.DAT wholesale and un-ignores upstream's own input decks by name
# (tests/regression/input_files/*.IN.DAT and friends); this deck was never
# added to that list and was silently untracked.  Re-include it here rather
# than editing the root file, which is upstream's and shared.
!scenarios/*.IN.DAT
